# MedTrack_DV
## Hospital Operations & Patient Analytics Dashboard

---

## Project Statement

This project aims to develop a comprehensive hospital operations and patient analytics dashboard suite to analyse hospital performance, patient admissions, department efficiency, and healthcare resource utilisation.

Using publicly available Hospital Datasets and Patient Admission Datasets, the project transforms healthcare operational data into actionable insights through interactive Tableau dashboards.

The dashboard suite helps hospital administrators, healthcare managers, medical staff, and policymakers to:

- Monitor patient flow
- Evaluate department performance
- Optimise hospital resources
- Analyse hospital admissions
- Improve operational efficiency
- Support data-driven decision-making

---

## Dataset Resources

### Dataset Name

**Hospital HMIS Dataset for Healthcare Analytics**

### Dataset Description

This dataset represents a synthetic but realistic Hospital Management Information System (HMIS) designed for healthcare analytics, dashboards, and operational insights.

It contains multiple interconnected tables covering:

- Patient information
- Admissions
- Departments
- Wards
- Beds
- Billing
- Insurance
- Staff management

The dataset represents the functioning of a hospital management information system.

The **Admission table acts as the central transactional table**, which can be connected with patient, department, ward, disease, and billing-related tables using common keys.

### Dataset Link

[Hospital HMIS Dataset for Healthcare Analytics – Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/shalakagangurde/hospital-hmis-dataset-for-healthcare-analytics)

